  "question": {
    "text": "The mean and standard deviation of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn></math> observations are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math> respectively. Later on, it was observed that one observation was recorded as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn></math> instead of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn></math>. Then the correct variance is",
